.PP
used by PDE_IntegratorUoM for assembly of a pre-eliminated solution matrix and RH vector (scalar versions, Luat Khoa Tran) AssignToGlobal matrix function

.PP
Ordering of nodes in the vectors is inner face nodes, outer face nodes, and intervening element nodes

.PP
\fBAuthor\fP
.RS 4
SKM - modified from LKT's version that eliminates Dirichlet constraints from G 
.RE
.PP

