.PP

.SS "template<uint32_t dim> void \fBcsmp::NumIntegral_dudn_op_u_dS_InterFace_w_dimM1_Region\fP< dim >::GetOperands (const \fBInterFace\fP< dim > & e)\fR [final]\fP, \fR [override]\fP"
Computes difference between the variable values at the topologically collocated nodes, including that in the intervening lower-dimensional region, using it to compute the transfer coefficient (=coupling coefficient) at the time level t + delta t\&.

